{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If four times the reciprocal of the circumference of a circle equals the diameter of the circle, then the area of the circle is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/d/67d651c9b247f47960c3fdd667906f46018fa72b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{\\pi^2}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\pi\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\pi^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"382\" height=\"37\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Creating equations, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/8/1b8783cc813c422d75c9e2e180daf60c02eb97f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot\\frac{1}{2\\pi r} = 2r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"96\" height=\"37\" />. Simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b8eab966afa0eddf90f8fa735074cd1bb5a161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\pi r} = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />. Multiplying each side by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/a/3ca4be71a120e3da894652420738112901f95b41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\pi} = r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"54\" height=\"37\" />. Because the formula of the area of a circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e89ed1c5456915b4e95e0c8a11257ac5ed3d32c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi r^2$\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, we multiply each side by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/4/c14713d69c2332cc216889d56d595a186a774bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 = \\pi r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />.\nTherefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b835874c9c1f3557c7bd4e562be169fa21a19968.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)  }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> \n</p><p>~awin\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•